'''Elf''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Knife Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is green with a dangling bell by the tip. By the heel of the blade is the red collar, which continues on a portion of the handle. The edge of the blade is silver, and a shadow of the bell can be seen on it. The guard is golden, and the handle has another collar which is green with red and white stripes below it.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Elf Gun (2015)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Elf_Set Elf Set].

